{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15d0_level_act15d0_07_end",
  "groupId": "act15d0",
  "stageId": "act15d0_07",
  "title": "背叛",
  "storyCode": "MB-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d4c256b3ac8e3c99014c4954c6b386d8b08d9e11e933e1b8ed55e23c0e43e770",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "text": "嘖，見鬼了，鑰匙卡到底哪裡去了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "text": "難道是上廁所的時候被我沖掉了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "巴頓老大，怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "text": "少管閒事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "是，是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "嘖，神氣什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警B",
      "text": "或許......又是誰觸了他的霉頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "嘿，我猜是安東尼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "也不知道是怎麼回事，好像有人要對他下手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "巴頓不是天天說我們監獄多麼好多麼完善，這下他肯定難受死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警B",
      "text": "我們也是獄警。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "哎，我不是高興有人刺殺，我就是看到他不爽就挺爽的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "而且說白了，咱們這些年，看倫道爾和巴頓做的齷齪事還少嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "要我說啊，倫道爾絕對知道這些刺客哪裡來的，他就是收了錢懶得管。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警B",
      "text": "......或許吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "咕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "別動，羅賓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "不要逼我殺你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "唔，真沒想到，我居然沒發現羅賓你是內奸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "說不定你有幹這行的天賦呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "等等，你手裡拿的是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "那是炸藥的開關？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "卡夫卡，快去啟動塔下沉的機關！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "嗚哇！燒起來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "我都要忘了是哪個了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "而且這些感覺都不能用了啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "啊，我找到了，應該是這個按鈕！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "拜託了，千萬要能用啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "我按！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "怎麼感覺沒怎麼動，難道真的是壞了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "羅賓，為什麼你要這麼做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "動了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "text": "*哥倫比亞俚語*",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "text": "算了，上次去頂樓都不知道是什麼時候了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "text": "下次跟倫道爾大哥說一聲補一張好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "text": "嘖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "巴頓老大，你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "您要幹嘛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "text": "我上去看看那些渣滓打掃得怎麼樣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "獄警A",
      "text": "怎......怎麼了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴頓",
      "text": "什麼東西，怎麼回事？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "抓緊身邊的東西，卡夫卡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "安東尼，那邊，羅賓要被甩進電梯裡去了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "抓緊我了，羅賓！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "為什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "現在不是說話的時候！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "咬緊牙根，別咬到舌頭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "安東尼，你和羅賓沒事吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "我沒事，羅賓在我懷裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "看來整個監獄的電力系統都癱瘓了，這裡一片漆黑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "這對我們來說算是一個機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "我剛才感覺塔直接往下硬穿了一層。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "我們現在應該在地下二層左右，距離醫務室還有些距離呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "嗯，趁獄警們還沒反應過來，走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "羅賓，你沒事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我......我沒事真的是好事嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "是好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "你可以不必這麼在意這件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "畢竟我早就說過，“你依然可以嘗試刺殺我”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "而如果你認為你做的事情是一種背叛，那我可以告訴你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "我們之間的關係恐怕也沒有好到可以討論信賴關係的時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "誒，我也不算嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "不算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡夫卡",
      "text": "誒，安東尼你好無情哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "恐怕對剛認識幾個月的人就完全信任才是有問題的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "當然，我確實會有些失望，但也僅此而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "但我依然好奇，你和我們相處的時間中表現出的那些情感並不是演戲，這我能夠看得出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "是什麼促使你做出這樣的選擇，羅賓？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我的父親，他能賺很多錢，也對我很好，是我引以為豪的父親。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "但是有一天，他的公司忽然倒閉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "在那之後，他再也沒有成功過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "於是他變了，他開始酗酒，開始變得易怒，開始痛恨身邊的一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "母親因此離開了他，他也背了許多債，最後，他因為肝臟問題和許多我根本看不懂的併發症住進了醫院。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "母親一直也勸我跟她一起生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "但我始終記得父親過去對我的好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我想要為他做些什麼，所以我放棄了許多過去的愛好，嘗試做了許多工作，但父親的醫藥費實在是太貴了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "直到有一天，有一個人找上我說，他可以給我許多錢，只要我幫他殺一個人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "那個人就是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "原來如此，我無法許諾你任何東西，所以你做了這個選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "不，他其實就在監獄裡假扮成獄警觀察著你，他叫傑斯頓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "你邀請我後，他找到我，告訴我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "是西蒙家族最後的反撲讓我父親的公司覆滅的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "......居然有這樣的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "這樣的話，恐怕我非但不應該責怪你，還應該向你道歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "不，你不要道歉，我不是想說這個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "不是這樣的，安東尼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我其實也覺得這樣是錯的，這樣是不好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "但是我放棄了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我不知道不這樣做我該怎麼做，我不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我好累啊，母親要我做出選擇，父親要我做出選擇，生活要我做出選擇，傑斯頓要我做出選擇，你也要我做出選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我不想做選擇，我不想判斷每一件事是對是錯，是好是壞，我不想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我好累啊，為什麼啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "但是，你不能把選擇權交給別人，羅賓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "你必須自己去思考每一件事，去做出每一個選擇，並為每一個選擇負責。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "否則的話，你是無法主宰自己的命運的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "這是我在這座監獄的幾年生活中學到的最重要的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "力量很重要，智慧也很重要，但最重要的，是勇氣，是為自己的選擇買單的勇氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "我也會恐懼自己出錯，但我不能就此逃避選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "我曾經以為我無人可以依靠是因為沒有找到依靠的對象，但後來我發現，這樣的對象並不存在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "我們只能依靠自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "我為我沒有及時發現你的痛苦而感到抱歉，羅賓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "我也再次向你強調，你做的事確實險些破壞了我的越獄計畫，因此我不會輕易說我原諒你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "但是站在一個曾經同樣經歷過與你類似痛苦的人的立場上，我希望你可以暫時忘記這件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "你必須重新審視自己，去思考，你究竟想要做什麼事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "我究竟......想要做什麼事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "前面就是杜瑪的房間了，你可以慢慢想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "......雖然你可能不相信我的話，但是，傑斯頓已經從我這裡知道了你們全部的越獄計畫，他一定在哪裡等著你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不，不用擔心找不到我，我就在這裡等著你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅賓",
      "text": "是杜瑪的房間裡傳來的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼",
      "text": "難道說......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
